      }
    },
    {
      "body": "@kpham-sgl could you take a look at this Gemma4 tool-parser fix if you have bandwidth? It prevents quoted brackets and stray `]` from corrupting array parsing; a `run-ci` label would help if it looks OK.",
      "created_at": "2026-07-07T18:06:08Z",
      "html_url": "https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/28857#issuecomment-4906998489",
      "id": 4906998489,
